# Internal dev/diagnostic tooling lives wholesale under spec/tools/ and is
# never published: scrapers, CDP probes, stat-diff, datamining extractors.
# FORWARD RULE: put any new internal scrape/probe/diff/extract/diagnostic
# tool here so it is private by default. CI tests (*_spec.lua) and data
# artifacts they consume must NOT live under spec/tools/.
spec/tools/
/*.log

# @leb-regression-guard:handoffs-not-in-repo
# Local hand-off notes are not repository documentation. Root-anchored so an
# accidentally created General/ directory stays untracked without catching the
# tracked src/Data/LEToolsImport/**/tab_gen_General___*.json files.
# Repository documentation belongs in docs/. Verify with `git add -A --dry-run`.
# Test: spec/System/TestHandoffsNotInRepo_spec.lua "ignores General/"
# See REGRESSION_GUARDS.md "handoffs-not-in-repo".
/General/

# Local working task list: holds internal task descriptions, branch names, and
